  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span>The Voter ID, formally known as the Election Photo Identity Card (EPIC), is an official photo identification issued by the Election Commission of India (ECI) to eligible Indian voters. It is used to confirm a voter’s identity, ensure a smooth and transparent voting process, and reduce the chances of impersonation and electoral malpractices during elections. Commonly, it is also called an election card, voter’s card, or Voter ID card.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Voter ID, officially called the Election Photo Identity Card (EPIC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Voter ID Registration &amp; Other Voter Service 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>Already Start</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>Not Available</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">No application fee is required to fill out the NVSP Online Voter ID Registration Form (only standard form charges may apply)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>&nbsp;Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Structure of Voter ID </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In India, a voter ID card serves as a valid form of personal identification since it is issued by an official government authority. It includes the following information.</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A unique Serial number (EPIC Number)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Photograph of the cardholder</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A hologram containing the respective state/national symbol</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Name of cardholder</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Father’s Name of cardholder</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Gender of cardholder</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Card holder’s Date of Birth</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Voter ID Card Eligibility </b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">To qualify for a Voter ID card, individuals must satisfy the following requirements.</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">An Indian citizen</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must be aged 18 years or above</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must have a permanent address</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Document Required for Pan Card </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Applying for a Voters ID requires you to submit the following documents.</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Passport size color Photograph</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Identity Proof</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Address Proof</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How to Apply for Voter ID Card Online </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 1:</strong>&nbsp;Go to the official National Voters’ Services Portal (NVSP) website.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 2:</strong>&nbsp;On the homepage, locate and click the ‘Sign-Up’ button at the top right corner.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 3:</strong>&nbsp;Provide your mobile number, email address, and the captcha code, then click ‘Continue’.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 4:</strong>&nbsp;Fill in your ‘First Name’, ‘Last Name’, set a ‘Password’, confirm it, and press ‘Request OTP’.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 5:</strong>&nbsp;Enter the OTP received on your mobile number and email, then click ‘Verify’.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 6:</strong>&nbsp;After verification, click on ‘Login’. Enter your mobile number, password, captcha code, and then click ‘Request OTP’.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 7:</strong>&nbsp;Input the OTP sent to your mobile device and click the ‘Verify &amp; Login’ button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 8:</strong>&nbsp;Once logged in, select the ‘Fill Form 6’ option under the ‘New registration for general electors’ section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 9:</strong>&nbsp;Complete Form 6 by entering your personal information, details of relatives, contact information, Aadhaar number, date of birth, address, and a declaration. Upload all necessary documents in the designated sections, then click ‘Preview and Submit’.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 10:</strong>&nbsp;Review all the entered information carefully. If everything is correct, click on ‘Submit’.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How to Apply for Voter ID Card Offline </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"documents\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 1:</strong>&nbsp;Visit the nearest State Election Office and request Form 6.</span></li>\n<li id=\"documents\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 2:</strong>&nbsp;Fill in the Form 6 with the required details.</span></li>\n<li id=\"documents\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Step 3:</strong>&nbsp;Submit the completed Form 6 along with a photo and supporting documents at the Election Office.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>New Voter ID Registration</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nvsp.in/Account/Register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Registration</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.nvsp.in/Account/Login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Login</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Voter ID Correction</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nvsp.in/Account/Login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Search Your Name in Voter List</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://electoralsearch.eci.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Know Your Booth AC / PC</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://electoralsearch.eci.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Know Your BLO, ERO / DEO</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://electoralsearch.eci.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Online Complaint Register (For Any Problem)</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Sarkari Exam Mobile App</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Join WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Join Telegram Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresulinfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener no